{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI reached Magdeburg at one this afternoon. The heat is oppressive, but I managed a walk by the Elbe. Thirteen Hamburg ships came in; the sight was grand, though the dockworkers were rough. I visited the cathedral to see the cast apostles by Fischer of Nuremberg. They are stiff, lifeless things—nature forced into bronze without breath. I also called on General Carnot. He is a polite man, but his conversation was dry as old bread. We drank wine, decent enough, and I paid two thalers for the meal.\n\nI am told the coach to Kassel leaves Tuesday noon. A coachman arrived this morning to drive an Englishman there in three days; he seems hurried. I hope you and the boys are well. I missed our cards last night. The air is thick here, and my head is heavy. I will write again when I am settled.\n\nYour affectionate\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795218893,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":205,"prompt_tokens":1130,"total_tokens":1335,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-cxcMKHdoEMXY76mlbX29kAnaSKaCuwGt","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1130,"prompt_ms":1057.807,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.936112389380531,"prompt_per_second":1068.2477994568007,"predicted_n":205,"predicted_ms":4807.256,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.564980392156865,"predicted_per_second":42.43585113836251}}